          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tap {{1}} {{3}} {{5}} on the first staff below: a major chord, one note at a time. The second staff holds the minor chord on the same root.\nOnce you can tell the two apart without looking, build both on another root. Use the Key selector below to change the key.\nWhen you change the key, the notes are new but the two chords still differ by one note."
          },
          {
            "type": "tool",
