              ],
              "mic": false
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Now tap {{1}} {{b3}} {{5}} on this staff: the minor chord. Only the 3rd moved, down a half step. Go back and forth between the two staffs and listen for that one note."
          },
          {
            "type": "tool",
